==Event Information==
A {{Color|#FF0000|'''"Survive! Mola Mola!"'''}} and "The Battle Cats" Collaboration Event!<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''Begins April 27th and continues to May 29th (10:59am)!'''}}

●'''Find the limited edition "Survive! Mola Mola!" Rare Gatcha at the Capsule Machine!'''<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''Collaboration capsules will appear April 27th through May 29th (10:59am)!'''}}<br>
Collect the Super Rare {{Color|#FF00FF|'''"'''}}[[Baby Mola (Super Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF00FF|'''Baby Mola'''}}]]{{Color|#FF00FF|'''"'''}} and Uber Rare {{Color|#FF00FF|'''"'''}}[[Mola King (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF00FF|'''King Mola'''}}]]{{Color|#FF00FF|'''"'''}} units, ONLY available during this collaboration event!

●'''New event stages appearing in The Battle Cats'''<br>
New weird enemies in crazy event stages!<br>
Take on Timed Score stages to gain special rewards for faster stage clear times!<br>
Clear the {{Color|#FF00FF|'''"Squid Bender"'''}} stage in The Battle Cats to unlock the {{Color|#FF00FF|'''"Together with Cats"'''}} adventure in Survive! Mola Mola!<br>
Visit the Stories of Legend during this campaign, tap "Battle" and select the Survive! Mola Mola! Map to begin the challenge!

●'''Play Survive! Mola Mola! to unlock a limited-edition character!'''<br>
Experience a sudden death while playing the {{Color|#FF00FF|'''"Battle Cats"'''}} mode in Survive! Mola Mola! during this event to unlock the special unit {{Color|#FF00FF|'''"'''}}[[Meowla Meowla (Special Cat)|{{Color|#FF00FF|'''Meowla Meowla'''}}]]{{Color|#FF00FF|'''"'''}} in The Battle Cats!

Check out Survive! Mola Mola! at the link below!

http://selectbutton.jp/apps/manbo

